The receipt printer's design, styles and PNG export are ported from
dsh-token-receipt (MIT, the same author): https://github.com/maxlee/dsh-token-receipt
Its stepped paper feed is adapted from the dqnamo receipt-printer study.

page/logo.js inlines magpie's mark, from https://usemagpie.ai/img/magpie-small.svg.
The mark belongs to the magpie project and is not covered by this package's MIT
license.

page/fonts.js embeds subsets of Inter and JetBrains Mono, both under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (page/fonts.LICENSE.txt).

All usage and costs come from magpie's own records through the `usage:day` read.
The page bundles no price catalogue and makes no network request.
